ead time plus a safety buffer sized from recent demand variability. When stock on hand falls to or below the reorder point the item is flagged for restocking.", "weights": {"demand": 0.12256, "stock": 0.13305, "reorder": 0.23149, "point": 0.23149, "level": 0.13672, "triggers": 0.13672, "new": 0.13672, "order": 0.13672, "platform": 0.13672, "forecast": 0.13672, "supplier": 0.13672, "lead": 0.11791, "time": 0.10455, "plus": 0.13672, "safety": 0.11791, "buffer": 0.13672, "sized": 0.13672, "recent": 0.10455, "variability": 0.13672, "hand": 0.13672, "falls": 0.13672, "item": 0.13672, "flagged": 0.11791, "restocking": 0.13672, "reorder point": 0.23149, "point stock": 0.13672, "stock level": 0.13672, "level triggers": 0.13672, "triggers new": 0.13672, "new order": 0.13672, "order platform": 0.13672, "platform forecast": 0.13672, "forecast demand": 0.13672, "demand supplier": 0.13672, "supplier lead": 0.13672, "lead time": 0.11791, "time plus": 0.13672, "plus safety": 0.13672, "safety buffer": 0.13672, "buffer sized": 0.13672, "sized recent": 0.13672, "recent demand": 0.13672, "demand variability": 0.13672, "variability stock": 0.13672, "stock hand": 0.13672, "hand falls": 0.13672, "falls reorder": 0.13672, "point item": 0.13672, "item flagged": 0.13672, "flagged restocking": 0.13672}}, {"id": "ops-safety-stock", "title": "Safety stock", "atc": null, "kind": "operations", "text": "Safety stock covers demand that is higher than expected during the lead time. It is larger for items whose daily sales swing a lot and smaller for steady sellers. It protects against stockouts without tying up cash in excess inventory.", "weights": {"steady": 0.10751, "demand": 0.08261, "daily": 0.11932, "stock": 0.08968, "lead": 0.13456, "time": 0.11932, "safety": 0.13456, "lead time": 0.13456, "covers": 0.15604, "higher": 0.15604, "expected": 0.15604, "larger": 0.15604, "items": 0.15604, "sales": 0.11932, "swing": 0.15604, "lot": 0.15604, "smaller": 0.15604, "sellers": 0.15604, "protects": 0.156